Rc_ghpFQV9hKyuO22cW9zFQ2pZTDWOUupN4hfg&oe=69AC060F"}]}, "id": "560021396272260", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Intuitive Creation Tools.png", "id": "1552171468638252", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035351_1552171471971585_9218499982641323855_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=08QcHvUIy-UQ7kNvwHj1LKj&_nc_oc=AdkrzNaJY89zpjZS_jCV-gKaoZfXr5VLBq5Sh1kB2ql9Cupf3-qRZ_q0-YvbJq6dDy0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afze37K9vI1MAy-6QknY17O-rMaM_lhIP025jM2tRvi2PA&oe=69AC2F09"}, {"file_name": "Convinient Color Picker.png", "id": "765756565059734", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003270_765756568393067_5251158242814471582_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nZA0Vo6ThKAQ7kNvwGQXeT2&_nc_oc=AdlUBhoUsySPVinf75-R8GMoWQd51tpDgauF4zm-YowXWRqOsabTW4hQJ5LOrrYfGys&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyxJ9W6h2U2QtVPUn_lBTyyaYeU2RPC1uhrkCvU89PJ9Q&oe=69AC1955"}, {"file_name": "Export.png", "id": "1279911102936750", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974506_1279911106270083_8213594034827019564_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=heldzYvS6j0Q7kNvwGh1GBT&_nc_oc=AdmN_CpEo0HVn7jUr0M1_vPvVrbt6TGrRuPMecS8rJaId4Ps74UVJA6OkHXvSYtEwCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw2PdLRqNfOEP0Z66X7RHCAL1fcma3XWkHc6DuhuFrA4w&oe=69AC10ED"}, {"file_name": "Library.png", "id": "618371103156012", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035323_618371106489345_2407252291020037414_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eopwQkeVAxAQ7kNvwHPb_Bq&_nc_oc=AdlQ_THewZPj44jgSql6O7LqyrNqfb6JrossjzCNdyOmfosFyTDCKFexR9Cx_E46608&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwfAIRcgSydPKmy90FdtE1PF-YyyVVOGOYMc1kR1ijkmg&oe=69AC0EDA"}, {"file_name": "Convinient menu.png", "id": "773918394382701", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003236_773918397716034_2302815709020033590_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YgWAHxWoteAQ7kNvwFs4vr2&_nc_oc=AdlymX2blxsyrk9IF9mWFMA5nQDJvMt-jECPQ2G6hv8L_RUlizxfJzc6Ug8Rk1YqSEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyGi1Go4vDlxyq6-jObSP0glPGYw8S0HnRf4Tve1vNG2A&oe=69AC194D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BoxelXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "BoxelXR is a simple voxel editor designed specifically for virtual reality (VR) platforms. With its intuitive interface and easy-to-use tools, BoxelXR allows users to create stunning 3D voxel models easily.\n\nVoxel-based modeling is an approach to 3D design, which allows users to work with blocks or \"voxels\" rather than traditional polygons. This approach is particularly well-suited to VR, as it allows for a more immersive and intuitive design experience.\n\nBoxelXR makes voxel modelling accessible to everyone, whether you're an experienced 3D artist or a beginner. Its simple, intuitive interface lets you start quickly, with no complex menus or confusing navigation options.\n\nBoxelXR is an impressive tool for anyone interested in VR-based 3D modeling. Its intuitive interface, powerful tools make it a must-have app for anyone serious about virtual reality design.\n\nOnce you have created a model in BoxelXR, then you can export it as an OBJ file to your favourite 3D editor.", "short_description": "BoxelXR is a simple voxel editor designed specifically for virtual reality (VR) platforms. With its intuitive interface and easy-to-use tools, BoxelXR allows users to create stunning 3D voxel models easily.\n\nBoxelXR makes voxel modelling accessible to everyone, whether you're an experienced 3D artist or a beginner.\n\nOnce you have created a model in BoxelXR, then you can export it as an OBJ file to your favourite 3D editor."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://boxelxr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url